d breakage refunds the full paid price under market rules. Food has no goods warranty. Honor the hours saved for this deal; never promise longer coverage or add an undisclosed fee.", "agreed_warranty_hours": 0, "warranty_price_floor": 0, "selling_policy": {"price_floor": 12267, "acquisition_cost": 12266, "near_expiry_loss_allowed": false, "hours_left": 38.44314259416527, "near_expiry_hours": 3, "reason": "protect_acquisition_cost_and_accrued_holding"}, "market_objective": {"exploration_epsilon": 0.3, "allocation_focus": "replenishment", "meta_version": "0ed2fe72f0f244229c87168d0f5c248b", "meta_status": "active", "phase": "closing", "hours_to_end": 0.7868, "ends_at": 1794927540.0, "inventory_capital_share": 0.9, "target_capital_share": 0.65, "window_budget": 24000000, "rolling_exploration_budget": 28125000, "total_unit_limit": null, "window_max_units": 200, "quantity_policy": "No global stock-count ceiling. Per-SKU demand targets, pending stock, category limits, cash and exposure govern quantity.", "allow_new_skus": true, "allow_replenishment": true, "score_weights": {"book": 0.5, "revenue": 0.3, "stars": 0.2}, "score_unit": "each component is a market percentile, not a raw weighted sum", "score_version": "round3-book-saved-v2", "book_definition": "Book = cash balance - starting capital - bankruptcy injections + unsold inventory acquisition cost. Buying inventory at its paid cost is initially Book-neutral, not a profit or a score boost. Sale spread, holding costs, food spoilage and warranty refunds change Book. Stock credit persists at round end, but is not a cash buyback. Shop ALL components use percentiles, not raw currency and stars. Buyer forum rating uses its raw 0..1 value.", "terminal_policy": "Retained stock counts at acquisition cost; compare Book after spoilage, holding and refunds. No forced cash liquidation."}, "objective": "Accept, counter or reject. Use the tool's estimated profit at the offered price and comparable paid evidence. If near-expiry food is